    "message": "Add owned GGUF shards and shared CPU row mathematics\n\nValidate complete GGUF shard sets with bounded buffered metadata reads and\nsame-owner C model loading and statistics. Share source scalar/SSE2 row math\nbetween tensor and model inference, preserve measured NaN and odd GLU behavior,\nand add an explicit audited OS erff boundary without native project code.\nRetain original fixtures, failed comparisons and both-host application/model\nvalidation. The full port remains incomplete; all twelve release gates stay open.",
